//: selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_surface_operation_proof_accepted_summary_eq: accepted summary が期待範囲か[返/かえ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_surface_operation_proof_accepted_summary_eq %fn SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplSurfaceOperationProofAcceptedSummary fn i32 fn SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateProofStatus fn SelfhostMemoTraitAggregateProofStatus bool \summary\expected_len\expected_copy\expected_drop:
    and:
        eq summary.table_len expected_len
        and:
            selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_surface_operation_proof_status_result_eq summary.copy_status expected_copy
            selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_surface_operation_proof_status_result_eq summary.drop_status expected_drop

//: selfhost_memo_trait_public_impl_surface_operation_proof_result_summary_eq: Result payload が期待 summary か[返/かえ]す
